<title>UK: Graseby CEO to join Balfour Beatty.</title>
<headline>Graseby CEO to join Balfour Beatty.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>BICC Plc said on Thursday that Paul Lester, currently chief executive with Graseby Plc, will become managing director of Balfour Beatty's UK construction activities.</p>
<p>The cables and systems manufacturer said in a statement that Lester will join Balfour on July 1.</p>
<p>Balfour is BICC's construction and engineering business.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
